* news_process v3.2.0 — Table 1: Descriptive Statistics (plan v14 §9.2)
*
* Loughran & McDonald 2011 JF 惯例: Table 1 报告 N / Mean / SD / Min / P25 / P50 / P75 / Max.
* Main spec choices: locus={{MAIN_LOCUS_TRACK}} subst={{MAIN_SUBST_TRACK}} sent={{MAIN_SENT_TRACK}}

version 19
* (假定已 use _prepared_panel.dta / 46_panel_yearly_full.dta + xtset; 2026-06-12 起单一全列 full.dta)

* 1. 关键变量清单 (按论文议题分组)
local sentiment_vars   llm_vote_tone_{{MAIN_SENT_TRACK}}     ///
                       llm_prob_score_{{MAIN_SENT_TRACK}}

local locus_vars       tech_frac_{{MAIN_LOCUS_TRACK}}       ///
                       app_frac_{{MAIN_LOCUS_TRACK}}

local subst_vars       sub_frac_{{MAIN_SUBST_TRACK}}        ///
                       symb_frac_{{MAIN_SUBST_TRACK}}

local gap_vars         tone_gap_tech_app_lc_ctx             ///
                       tone_gap_sub_symb_sc_ctx

local bank_controls    bank_size bank_age digital_frontier
local coverage         n_articles media_breadth ln_news_coverage

* 2. tabstat 输出 (顶刊 standards)
local all_vars `sentiment_vars' `locus_vars' `subst_vars' `gap_vars' `bank_controls' `coverage'

* 过滤实际存在的列, 缺失列警告但不报错
local existing_vars
foreach v of local all_vars {
    capture confirm variable `v'
    if !_rc {
        local existing_vars `existing_vars' `v'
    }
    else {
        display "  ⚠️ Var `v' 不存在, Table 1 跳过"
    }
}

* 3. esttab 输出 (booktabs LaTeX, plan v14 §9.5)
capture which estpost
if !_rc {
    estpost tabstat `existing_vars', ///
        statistics(N mean sd min p25 p50 p75 max) ///
        columns(statistics)

    * st-descriptives-01 fix (2026-06-03): 本表在 master 流程中先于主回归 (11_table2)
    * 运行 (00_master.do L26 在 L27 之前), 故 e(sample) 尚未填充, 无法用 if e(sample)
    * 限定到回归样本. 描述统计覆盖全面板 (含零新闻 bank-year), 与主回归 if e(sample)
    * 样本 N 不一致 — 在表注如实披露, 供审稿人对账 (顶刊复现包诚实度).
    esttab using "output/tables/table1_descriptives.tex", ///
        cells("count(fmt(0)) mean(fmt(3)) sd(fmt(3)) min(fmt(3)) p25(fmt(3)) p50(fmt(3)) p75(fmt(3)) max(fmt(3))") ///
        nonumber booktabs replace ///
        title("Table 1: Descriptive Statistics") ///
        note("Main spec: locus={{MAIN_LOCUS_TRACK}}, subst={{MAIN_SUBST_TRACK}}, sent={{MAIN_SENT_TRACK}}. " ///
             "Descriptives computed over the full bank-year panel (incl. zero-news bank-years); " ///
             "the regression sample (if e(sample), Tables 2+) excludes obs with missing DV/treatment and thus differs in N.")

    display "✅ Table 1 written to output/tables/table1_descriptives.tex"
}
else {
    display "  ⚠️ estpost not installed (ssc install estout); Table 1 跳过"
}
